Fourteen white cubes are put together to form the figure on the right.  The complete surface of the figure, including the bottom, is painted red.  The figure is then separated into individual cubes.  How many of the individual cubes have exactly four red faces?

[asy]
size(150);
pair a=(1,0),b=(0,1),c=(0.45,0.4);

void drawcube(pair loc){
     filldraw(loc+b--loc--loc+a--loc+a+c--loc+a+b+c--loc+b+c--cycle,white);
     draw(loc+b--loc+a+b--loc+a+b+c^^loc+a+b--loc+a);
}

pair location[]={origin,b,a,2a,3a,3a+b,-c,3a-c,-2c,-2c+b,-2c+a,-2c+2a,-2c+3a,-2c+3a+b};

for(int i; i<14;++i){
   drawcube(location[i]);
}


[/asy]

In regular pentagon $PQRST$, $X$ is the midpoint of segment $ST$. What is the measure of angle $XQS,$ in degrees?

[asy]
size(101);
picture p;
pair P = (0,0); pair Q = (-cos(108),sin(108)); pair R = Q + expi(36*pi/180); pair T = (1,0); pair S1 = T + (cos(108),sin(108));
draw(p,(P--Q--R--S1--T--cycle),linewidth(1)); pair X = (S1+T)/2;
label(p,rotate(20)*"$P$",P,rotate(20)*W,fontsize(10pt)); label(p,rotate(20)*"$Q$",Q,rotate(20)*NW,fontsize(10pt)); label(p,rotate(20)*"$R$",R,S,fontsize(10pt)); label(p,rotate(20)*"$S$",S1,rotate(20)*E,fontsize(10pt)); label(p,rotate(20)*"$T$",T,rotate(20)*N,fontsize(10pt));label(p,rotate(20)*"$X$",X,rotate(-40)*NE,fontsize(10pt));
dot(p,X);
add(rotate(-20)*p);
[/asy]

